    "name": "Papi's Playhouse",
    "steam_appid": 3686410,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686410/extras/87253cc050ccac2e5f79d8cefc6f8540.avif?t=1751370536\" data-has-big width=800 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A first-person multiplayer card game of hidden roles, bluffing, and real-time shootouts.</strong><br>Set inside a gritty bar, players sit face-to-face at the table, but no one knows whom to trust.<br>Play your cards, pick up your weapons, and stay alive. It's not just about winning\u2026 It\u2019s about surviving the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686410/extras/7e6cbeb575e13dad573a45b4c00305aa.poster.avif?t=1751370536\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686410/extras/7e6cbeb575e13dad573a45b4c00305aa.webm?t=1751370536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686410/extras/7e6cbeb575e13dad573a45b4c00305aa.mp4?t=1751370536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686410/extras/0c966bb602ca2c493c27254e3e8cf11c.avif?t=1751370536\" data-has-big width=800 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>First-person multiplayer</strong> with up to 7 players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Hidden roles</strong> and unique win conditions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39<strong>Unique perks,</strong> making each game feel different</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39<strong>Distance-based</strong>\u00a0<strong>combat:</strong> shoot players within range</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Different weapons</strong>: grab, aim, and shoot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39<strong>Different types of cards:\u00a0</strong>action, passive, trap</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Voice chat deception</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Set in a fully immersive bar</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686410/extras/e6fd5504a7d6e6aadf5e47bf633c6df9.poster.avif?t=1751370536\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686410/extras/e6fd5504a7d6e6aadf5e47bf633c6df9.webm?t=1751370536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686410/extras/e6fd5504a7d6e6aadf5e47bf633c6df9.mp4?t=1751370536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686410/extras/4972df6bdc5e18fd37abca19255aad6e.avif?t=1751370536\" data-has-big width=800 height=141 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of every match, you\u2019re assigned a role:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mafia Boss</strong> \u2013 eliminate threats and lead your team</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goons </strong>\u2013 protect the Boss at all costs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cops</strong> \u2013 take down the mafia, no matter what</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rat </strong>\u2013 play both sides and be the last one standing</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each role has a unique win condition, but you\u2019ll have to bluff, lie, and improvise to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686410/extras/701029af459dfd46c3ca82e745ed61ba.poster.avif?t=1751370536\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686410/extras/701029af459dfd46c3ca82e745ed61ba.webm?t=1751370536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686410/extras/701029af459dfd46c3ca82e745ed61ba.mp4?t=1751370536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686410/extras/9766bfb00dd81ea2510f902d67d3468e.avif?t=1751370536\" data-has-big width=800 height=141 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alliances shift every second</strong>. Some players will have your back, until they don\u2019t. Use voice chat, read the room, and figure out who\u2019s lying before it\u2019s too late.\u00a0Games are intense and full of backstabbing. <strong>Victory only comes to those who observe, adapt, and survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686410/extras/f8a40021a193609de3db2a4447b47c81.poster.avif?t=1751370536\" width=800 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686410/extras/f8a40021a193609de3db2a4447b47c81.webm?t=1751370536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686410/extras/f8a40021a193609de3db2a4447b47c81.mp4?t=1751370536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
